 having the discovery of you  as a player be like  oh I can do this I think there's  absolutely room for games that really  focus on the hardcore but just because  you open the door a little wider doesn't  mean the house is any less complex you  know it doesn't mean that there are  fewer rooms in the house as it were so I  would ask them to play it themselves  give it a try  throughout my time with relic they had a  confidence with the balance they've  struck with Dawn of War three but as we  wait for the fans reception on release  day where does this put relic are they  still the powerhouse pioneers of  strategy and other moves they've made  with Dawn of War 3 and indication to the  direction of the RTS genre as a whole  the intent is that this is a return to  you know the high quality games that  we've always done but this is showing  that you know we're back Don war is back  and you know I promise that relic is  going to continue to produce these  high-quality games ultimately those are  the things that it sounds really cheesy  for me to say it right like I believe in  this game to the bottom of my being I've  poured my heart and soul into it  ultimately it's going to be the  consumers the players who are going to  have that judgment it's up to them  whether they loved it or not to me what  I hope we're at is a place where we're  continuing to push the genre and that we  don't so well I was successful so let's  just you know sit on our rest on our  laurels I want to continue to push and  when I continue to to challenge the  boundaries of what strategy can be I  think that that's probably where relic  will continue to go and and I hope that  I'm right that we continue to make and  continue to challenge the the genre  thank you so much for watching this  behind-the-scenes look at the making of  Dawn of War 3 if you enjoyed the video  major hit the like button subscribe and  leave your thoughts in the comment  section down below now personally I'm a  massive Dawn of War fan and I'm a  massive Warhammer fan as well so this  project was an amazing opportunity for  me so I would really love to know your  thoughts if you did like this video well  we've got another one coming very  shortly it's all about relic the history  of the studio and its legacy we spent  maybe two days with the guys in  Vancouver so we've got some great  interviews some great thoughts so I  really hope you check it out so until I  see you on that video I will see you  next time  [Music]  huh
 

